---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import '../../styles/lab.css';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Layout
  title="小伙的快乐排序 · Telrest"
  description="用 C 写的快速排序，编译成 WebAssembly 在浏览器里运行。输入一组数字直接排序，或者一步步看它怎样分组。"
>
  <main id="main" class="lab-page">
    <header class="lab-hero">
      <a class="lab-back" href={base}><Icon name="arrow" size={15} class="flip-arrow" />回到首页</a>
      <p class="lab-eyebrow">TELREST / LAB <span>EXPERIMENT NO. 001</span></p>
      <h1>小伙的快乐排序</h1>
      <p class="lab-lead">用 C 写的快速排序，编译成 WebAssembly 在浏览器里运行。<br />输入一组数字直接排序，或者一步步看它怎样分组。</p>
      <p class="lab-code">验证码 / Code · <strong>200865</strong></p>
    </header>

    <div class="lab-body">
      <section class="card" aria-labelledby="input-title">
        <form id="partition-form">
          <label for="mode">选择功能 <span lang="en">/ Choose a mode</span></label>
          <select id="mode" name="mode">
            <option value="sort">完整排序 / Full sort</option>
            <option value="visual">排序过程 / Visualization</option>
            <option value="partition">一轮分组 / One partition</option>
          </select>

          <label id="input-title" for="numbers">输入数字 <span lang="en">/ Input numbers</span></label>
          <textarea id="numbers" name="numbers" rows="3" maxlength="20000" aria-describedby="input-hint" spellcheck="false">3 1 5 2 6 4</textarea>
          <p id="input-hint" class="hint">用空格、换行或逗号分隔。排序最多 1024 个数，可视化最多 64 个数。<br /><span lang="en">Separate with spaces, newlines, or commas. Up to 1,024 numbers for sorting; 64 for visualization.</span></p>

          <div class="actions">
            <button id="run" type="submit" disabled>运行 <span lang="en">/ Run</span></button>
            <button id="example" class="secondary" type="button">恢复示例 <span lang="en">/ Reset example</span></button>
            <span id="status" class="status" role="status">加载中 / Loading</span>
          </div>
        </form>
        <p id="error" class="error" role="alert" hidden></p>
      </section>

      <section class="card" aria-labelledby="result-title">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 id="result-title">运行结果 <span lang="en">/ Result</span></h2>
          <span id="pivot-label" class="pivot-label" hidden></span>
        </div>

        <div id="playback" class="playback" hidden>
          <div class="actions">
            <button id="play" type="button">播放 / Play</button>
            <button id="previous" class="secondary" type="button">上一步 / Previous</button>
            <button id="next" class="secondary" type="button">下一步 / Next</button>
            <button id="restart" class="secondary" type="button">从头查看 / Restart</button>
          </div>

          <label class="speed-label" for="speed">每步间隔 / Step interval
            <select id="speed">
              <option value="1200">1.2 秒 / seconds</option>
              <option value="600">0.6 秒 / seconds</option>
              <option value="250">0.25 秒 / seconds</option>
            </select>
          </label>

          <label for="timeline">查看步骤 / Browse steps</label>
          <input id="timeline" type="range" min="0" max="1" value="0" step="1" />
          <p id="step-description" class="step-description" aria-live="polite"></p>
          <div id="bars" class="bars" aria-label="排序柱状图 / Sorting bars"></div>
          <p class="hint">柱高按这组数字的范围缩放，下方显示实际数值。每一步对应一次分组结束。<br /><span lang="en">Bar heights are scaled to the input range; actual values appear below. Each step shows a completed partition.</span></p>
        </div>

        <div id="result" class="numbers" role="status" aria-live="polite">
          <p class="placeholder">选择功能后点击“运行”。<br /><span lang="en">Choose a mode, then click “Run”.</span></p>
        </div>
        <p id="position" class="hint" hidden></p>

        <div id="legend" class="legend" aria-label="颜色说明 / Color legend" hidden>
          <span><i class="dot left"></i>小于基准 / Below pivot</span>
          <span><i class="dot pivot"></i>基准 / Pivot</span>
          <span><i class="dot right"></i>大于或等于基准 / At least pivot</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <footer class="lab-foot">
        <p>每段的最后一个数作为基准；先处理左段，再处理右段。</p>
        <p>源码 <a href="https://github.com/Telrest/quicksort-learning" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">quicksort-learning</a> · C → WebAssembly</p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </main>

  <script is:inline src={`${base}lab/quicksort/partition.js`}></script>
  <script is:inline defer src={`${base}lab/quicksort/app.js`}></script>
</Layout>
